DTSTART:20260223T001000Z
DTEND:20260223T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20260223T001000Z
UID:jdav4g6we7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nWorld of Wong Kar Wai Lost souls
  reach out for human connection amidst the glimmering night world of Hong 
 Kong in Wong Kar Wai’s hallucinatory\, neon-soaked nocturne. Presented 
 in 4K.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/world-of-wong-kar-wai/w
 orld-of-wong-kar-wai-fallen-angels\n\nEstimated start: 16:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
